OL,3,GNEWSA'I could lose home over proposed  
OL,4,ANeets reforms'                         
OL,6,FA student living with a rare connective
OL,7,Ftissue disorder said proposed          
OL,8,Fdisability benefit cuts for young      
OL,9,Fpeople could be "devastating, and could
OL,10,Fleave her without a home.              
OL,12,FElspeth Edwards, from Worcester, who   
OL,13,Fhas Ehlers-Danlos syndrome, said the   
OL,14,Fchanges would "ruin" her life and could
OL,15,Fmean she is unable to afford her rent. 
OL,17,FA major review by former minister Alan 
OL,18,FMilburn has proposed widespread changes
OL,19,Fto help get young people who are not in
OL,20,Feducation, employment or training      
OL,21,F(Neet) into work across the UK.        
